      "item_id": "MDA-GOV-2026-001-0003",
      "information_type": "metric",
      "stated_text": "In the first six months of 2026, 71% of public service requests were submitted online, 7 percentage points more than in 2025. Thus, out of a total of 4.5 million requests registered in the period January–June 2026, 3.2 million, or 71 percent, were submitted online, while the number of those submitted at the counter reached 1.3 million.",
      "quote_language": "en",
      "translation_en": null,
      "machine_translated": false,
      "summary": "AGE: 71% of requests (3.2 of 4.5 million) were online in January to June 2026, up 7 points on 2025.",
